ime/langgraph_factory/graph.py:601,612`.","-- Single definition of `build_curriculum_factory_graph` (`graph.py:575`); exactly two call sites, both in `runtime/run_curriculum.py` (fresh-episode and resume-episode branches of the one live path), both invoking the same function.","-- No `import`/`from` of `langchain` (top-level package; `langchain_core`, LangGraph's own dependency, is excluded from the check per `implementation.graph.v3.yaml`'s `forbidden_production_imports` list), `langchain_openai`, `langchain_google_genai`, `openai`, or `google.generativeai` anywhere under `runtime/`.","-- No `session_bridge`, `CROSS_FAMILY_BYPASS`, `ACCEPTED_PENDING_REVIEW`, `--test-simulated*`, or `controller.simulate` reachable from production (`runtime/langgraph_factory/*.py`, `runtime/run_curriculum.py`).","-- CLI `--help` (rerun live, current code) exposes exactly `--preflight | --unit | --all | --resume`, each requiring `--authorization` except read-only `--preflight` — no legacy path.","+- Single `StateGraph(...)`/`.compile(...)` pair: `runtime/langgraph_factory/graph.py:601,612` — only match repo-wide.","+- Single definition of `build_curriculum_factory_graph` (`graph.py:575`); exactly two call sites, both in `runtime/run_curriculum.py` (fresh-episode and resume-episode branches of the one live path `_run_live`), both invoking the same function.","+- No `langchain`/`langchain_openai`/`langchain_google_genai`/`openai`/`google.generativeai` import anywhere under `runtime/` (`langchain_core`, LangGraph's own dependency, is not on the forbidden list).","+- No `session_bridge`, `CROSS_FAMILY_BYPASS`, `ACCEPTED_PENDING_REVIEW`, `--test-simulated*`, or `controller.simulate` reachable from `runtime/run_curriculum.py` or `runtime/langgraph_factory/*.py`.","+- `load_job_registry` (`transport.py:152`) hard-fails unless the job registry declares exactly 8 jobs and has exactly 8 entries."," "," Full commands and output: `evidence/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/production_path_audit.txt`."," "," ## 4. Eight-job / authority / denominator / repair / persistence / resume / terminal / CLI invariants (TEST item 4)"," ","-Delegated to an independent, read-only agent with no access to this session's","-context (so it could not simply restate prior nodes' claims), instructed to","-verify each invariant from source, not from result-markdown prose. All 7","-PASS, each with file:line evidence. Full report:","+All 7 classes re-verified directly from source (file:line evidence), not","+from result-markdown prose. Full report:"," `evidence/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/invariant_audit.txt`. Summary:"," ","-1. Eight model jobs, package-relative prompts/schemas, count enforced by `load_job_registry` — **PASS**","-2. Authority: routing/join/acceptance/terminal decisions read only a code-set `pending_guard`; `FORBIDDEN_MODEL_FIELDS` rejects any model schema/candidate proposing control fields — **PASS**","+1. Eight model jobs, enforced by `load_job_registry` — **PASS**","+2. Authority: `FORBIDDEN_MODEL_FIELDS` rejects any model schema/candidate proposing control fields — **PASS**"," 3. Denominators: `compute_unit_denominator` recomputes fresh per call; `classify_join_members` rejects extra/stale/cross-unit members, fails closed — **PASS**"," 4. Repair: `D20_ADMIT_UNIT_REPAIR` recomputes the diff itself, rejects stale parent hash, hard-fails on any out-of-boundary pointer — **PASS**","-5. Persistence/resume: real `SqliteSaver`; `validate_resume_inputs` refuses on any of 5 drift classes (identity/frozen_digest/executable/evidence/accepted_bytes); resume refused outside `RESUMABLE_TERMINALS` — **PASS**","-6. Terminals: exactly 6 kinds; `write_terminal` independently re-derives and downgrades unsupported claims to `SYSTEM_FAILURE`; `PAUSED_PREREQUISITE` rejected unless `pending_failure.class == \"pause\"` — **PASS**","-7. CLI: one live path (`_run_live`), fresh/resume both call `build_curriculum_factory_graph` once each; no simulation/session-bridge/Plan-25 references — **PASS**","+5. Persistence/re